{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"Sünen-i Tirmizi","section":{"2":"The Book on Salat (Prayer)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":149,"hadithnumber_last":451,"arabicnumber_first":149,"arabicnumber_last":451,"name_native":"Namaz Kitabı"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":202,"arabicnumber":202,"text":"Câbir (r.a.)’den rivâyet edildiğine göre, şöyle demiştir: “Rasûlullah (s.a.v.)’in müezzini ezandan sonra biraz bekler kamet getirmez, Peygamber (s.a.v.)’in mescide çıktığını görünce hemen kamet getirirdi.”","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":54}}]}